        rdfs:comment                   "Scarf of red fine woven silk, the field is a decorative lattice of gold-wrapped thread, the borders have diagonal bands of gold-wrapped thread with a plant motif, the deep end borders have a diagonal pattern with zigzags above and below. Gold fringes at both ends. Complete piece."@en , "Textile, scarf, fine woven silk or cotton and gold-wrapped thread, India, probably Varanasi, ca. 1850"@en , "Intended for use as a garment, clothing."@en ;
